"""Thunderstorm: a tier above On fire (Christopher, 17 Oct 2026: "push thunderstorm to live", then "pulses across
his entire row like stats and name too").

Who: a hot player (Frozen Pool) with 2.5+ NHL points a game over 7+ games.  On 17 Oct 2026 only Connor McDavid.
What: a bigger flame behind the portrait, three lightning bolts striking it in turn, and on each strike the whole
row flashes electric blue (portrait ring, name, stats, points) with a bolt tearing across it.  The flame icon's
title and tooltip say "Thunderstorm".  Everything stops under reduced motion.

    python build/storm_tier.py index.html
Safe to run again; keeps the file's own line endings.
"""
